               <height>200</height>
              </size>
             </property>
            </widget>
           </item>
          </layout>
         </item>
         <item>
          <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="namingRightColumn">
           <item>
            <widget class="QLabel" name="lblContainerHeader">
             <property name="text">
              <string>容器子节点后缀（正则表达式）</string>
             </property>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item>
            <widget class="MapEdit" name="containerSuffix">
             <property name="minimumSize">
              <size>
               <width>0</width>
               <height>100</height>
              </size>
             </property>
             <property name="maximumSize">
              <size>
               <width>16777215</width>
               <height>140</height>
              </size>
             </property>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item>
            <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="netRoleGroupRow">
             <item>
              <widget class="QLabel" name="lblGroupHeader">
               <property name="text">
                <string>角色1P/2P/3P SwitchGroup 名称</string>
               </property>
              </widget>
             </item>
             <item>
              <widget class="QLineEdit" name="iptNetRoleGroup">
               <property name="sizePolicy">
                <sizepolicy hsizetype="Expanding" vsizetype="Fixed">
                 <horstretch>0</horstretch>
                 <verstretch>0</verstretch>
                </sizepolicy>
               </property>
              </widget>
             </item>
            </layout>
           </item>
           <item>
            <widget class="MapEdit" name="netRoleValues">
             <property name="minimumSize">
              <size>
               <width>0</width>
               <height>140</height>
              </size>
             </property>
             <property name="toolTip">
              <string>角色：1P（主角）/2P（队友）/3P（敌人）。Switch 名称：对应的 Switch 分支名。对象名后缀：拆分时该角色对象的名称后缀。Bus后缀：该角色 Bus 的名称后缀；把 2P 的 Bus 后缀填成 3P 的后缀即表示不区分 2P/3P Bus，两者复用同一个 Bus。</string>
             </property>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item>
            <spacer name="namingRightSpacer">
             <property name="orientation">
              <enum>Qt::Vertical</enum>
             </property>
             <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
              <size>
               <width>20</width>
               <height>40</height>
              </size>
             </property>
            </spacer>
           </item>
          </layout>
         </item>
        </layout>
        </widget>
       </item>
      </layout>
     </widget>
    <widget class="QWidget" name="tabTools">
     <attribute name="title">
      <string>工具行为</string>
     </attribute>
     <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="tabToolsLayout">
      <item>
        <widget class="QGroupBox" name="grpSearchAndFilter">
         <property name="title">
          <string>查找与筛选</string>
         </property>
         <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="searchAndFilterLayout">
          <item>
           <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="searchRow">
       <item>
        <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbxAutoFetchChildren">
         <property name="text">
          <string>工具执行前自动获取子对象</string>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item>
        <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbxFindFilterCheckedOnly">
         <property name="text">
          <string>查找/筛选只对选中对象生效</string>
         </property>
         <property name="toolTip">
          <string>勾选后，找父级/找子级/找引用/高级查找以及表格筛选只处理「选中」列勾选的行，未勾选的行原样保留并始终显示；取消勾选则对全部可见行生效。</string>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
             <item>
              <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbxKeepSelf">
              <property name="text">
               <string>保留原始层级</string>
              </property>
              <property name="toolTip">
               <string>高级查找子对象时，查找结果同时保留输入对象自身。</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QLabel" name="lblPageSize">
              <property name="text">
               <string>查询分页大小</string>
              </property>
              <property name="toolTip">
               <string>WAAPI 查询子对象/后代/批量查找时每次拉取的数量。调大能减少请求次数，但单次请求更重；主窗口查找对象与各工具共用该值。</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spbPageSize">
              <property name="toolTip">
               <string>默认 500，可调范围 10-1000。调大能减少请求次数，但单次请求更重。</string>
              </property>
              <property name="minimum">
               <number>10</number>
              </property>
              <property name="maximum">
               <number>1000</number>
              </property>
              <property name="singleStep">
               <number>10</number>
              </property>
              <property name="value">
               <number>500</number>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <spacer name="searchRowSpacer">
              <property name="orientation">
               <enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum>
              </property>
              <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
               <size>
                <width>40</width>
                <height>20</height>
               </size>
              </property>
             </spacer>
            </item>
           </layout>
          </item>
          <item>
           <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="filterCheckRow">
            <item>
             <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbxCaseSensitive">
              <property name="text">
               <string>区分大小写</string>
              </property>
              <property name="toolTip">
               <string>主窗口表格关键词筛选时区分英文字母大小写。</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbxOnlyIncluded">
              <property name="text">
               <string>仅显示启用对象</string>
              </property>
              <property name="toolTip">
               <string>过滤掉工程中未启用的对象（含上级未启用的层级）。</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbxOnlyInUse">
              <property name="text">
               <string>只显示在用资源</string>
              </property>
              <property name="toolTip">
               <string>只显示被 WorkUnit 内当前语言实际引用的音频源。</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <spacer name="filterCheckSpacer">
              <property name="orientation">
               <enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum>
              </property>
              <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
               <size>
                <width>40</width>
                <height>20</height>
               </size>
              </property>
             </spacer>
            </item>
           </layout>
          </item>
          <item>
           <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="filterRadioRow">
            <item>
             <widget class="QLabel" name="lblEventFilter">
              <property name="text">
               <string>Event引用：</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QRadioButton" name="rbnEventAll">
              <property name="text">
               <string>全部</string>
              </property>
              <property name="checked">
               <bool>true</bool>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QRadioButton" name="rbnEventHas">
              <property name="text">
               <string>有引用</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QRadioButton" name="rbnEventNo">
              <property name="text">
               <string>无引用</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <spacer name="filterRadioMiddleSpacer">
              <property name="orientation">
               <enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum>
              </property>
              <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
               <size>
                <width>20</width>
                <height>20</height>
               </size>
              </property>
             </spacer>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QLabel" name="lblLanguageFilter">
              <property name="text">
               <string>语言筛选：</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QRadioButton" name="rbnLangAll">
              <property name="text">
               <string>全部语言</string>
              </property>
              <property name="checked">
               <bool>true</bool>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QRadioButton" name="rbnLangActive">
              <property name="text">
               <string>仅当前语言</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <spacer name="filterRadioEndSpacer">
              <property name="orientation">
               <enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum>
              </property>
              <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
               <size>
                <width>40</width>
                <height>20</height>
               </size>
              </property>
             </spacer>
            </item>
           </layout>
          </item>
         </layout>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item>
        <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbxDetailLog">
         <property name="toolTip">
          <string>打开后会把批量处理中每个对象的处理记录、以及每次 WAAPI 调用的参数与耗时写进日志文件（gui_log.log / mcp_log.log）。日志量大时会产生额外磁盘写入，排查问题后再关掉即可。</string>
         </property>
         <property name="text">
          <string>记录明细日志（批量逐对象、WAAPI 调用流水）</string>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item>
        <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbxDumpOnlyWritable">
         <property name="toolTip">
          <string>勾选时，「导出全部属性（JSON）」只写可写属性：跳过 id/name/path/children/descendants 等只读访问器，以及列表、无 id 的复合值；取消勾选则导出 schema 里的全部属性值。</string>
         </property>
         <property name="text">
          <string>导出属性时仅包含可写属性</string>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item>
        <widget class="QGroupBox" name="grpConversion">
         <property name="title">
          <string>自动转码</string>
         </property>
         <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="conversionRow">
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="lblConversionDominance">
            <property name="text">
             <string>长短音效占优比例</string>
            </property>
            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>自动转码时，某个节点上的长/短音效占比要严格超过该比例，才会覆盖上层设置；占比不够明显（如 40:60）时继承上层，交给更下层的节点决定。默认 60%，即 40:60 分界。</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spbConversionDominance">
            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>自动转码时，某个节点上的长/短音效占比要严格超过该比例，才会覆盖上层设置；占比不够明显（如 40:60）时继承上层，交给更下层的节点决定。默认 60%，即 40:60 分界。</string>
            </property>
            <property name="minimum">
             <number>50</number>
            </property>
            <property name="maximum">
             <number>100</number>
            </property>
            <property name="singleStep">
             <number>5</number>
            </property>
            <property name="suffix">
             <string> %</string>
            </property>
            <property name="value">
             <number>60</number>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <spacer name="conversionRowSpacer">
            <property name="orientation">
             <enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum>
            </property>
            <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
             <size>
              <width>40</width>
              <height>20</height>
             </size>
            </property>
           </spacer>
          </item>
         </layout>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item>
        <widget class="QGroupBox" name="grpLoudness">
         <property name="title">
          <string>响度设置</string>
         </property>
         <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="loudnessRow">
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="lblLoudnessStandard">
            <property name="text">
             <string>响度标准</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QComboBox" name="cbbLoudnessStandard">
            <property name="minimumSize">
             <size>
              <width>90</width>
              <height>0</height>
             </size>
            </property>
            <item>
             <property name="text">
              <string>RMS</string>
             </property>
            </item>
            <item>
             <property name="text">
              <string>LUFS</string>
             </property>
            </item>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="lblTargetLoudness">
            <property name="text">
             <string>目标响度</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spbTargetLoudness">
            <property name="suffix">
             <string> dBFS</string>
            </property>
            <property name="minimum">
             <number>-60</number>
            </property>
            <property name="maximum">
             <number>0</number>
            </property>
            <property name="value">
             <number>-18</number>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="lblLoudnessTolerance">
            <property name="text">
             <string>宽容度</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="spbLoudnessTolerance">
            <property name="suffix">
             <string> dB</string>
            </property>
            <property name="decimals">
             <number>1</number>
            </property>
            <property name="minimum">
             <double>0.000000000000000</double>
            </property>
            <property name="maximum">
             <double>20.000000000000000</double>
            </property>
            <property name="singleStep">
             <double>0.500000000000000</double>
            </property>
            <property name="value">
             <double>1.000000000000000</double>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <spacer name="loudnessSpacer">
            <property name="orientation">
             <enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum>
            </property>
            <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
             <size>
              <width>40</width>
              <height>20</height>
             </size>
            </property>
           </spacer>
          </item>
         </layout>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item>
        <widget class="QGroupBox" name="grpLocalization">
         <property name="title">
          <string>本地化</string>
         </property>
         <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="localizationLayout">
          <item>
           <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="referenceLanguageRow">
            <item>
             <widget class="QLabel" name="lblReferenceLanguage">
              <property name="text">
               <string>参考语言</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbxUseDefaultReferenceLanguage">
              <property name="text">
               <string>使用工程默认</string>
              </property>
              <property name="toolTip">
               <string>勾选后直接读取 Wwise 工程的参考语言（referenceLanguageId）；取消勾选则使用右边手填的语言名，静音填补空缺等本地化工具与多语言对比都会用到。</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QLineEdit" name="ledReferenceLanguage">
              <property name="minimumSize">
               <size>
                <width>120</width>
                <height>0</height>
               </size>
              </property>
              <property name="placeholderText">
               <string>例如 EN</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <spacer name="referenceLanguageSpacer">
              <property name="orientation">
               <enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum>
              </property>
              <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
               <size>
                <width>40</width>
                <height>20</height>
               </size>
              </property>
             </spacer>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QLabel" name="lblLanguagesHeader">
              <property name="text">
               <string>未接入语言（用分号分隔）</string>
              </property>
              <property name="toolTip">
               <string>这些语言尚未接入，工程检查时不会要求它们存在对应语音，也不参与本地化检查。多个语言用分号分隔，例如 Chinese;Japanese。</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QLineEdit" name="iptLanguages">
              <property name="minimumSize">
               <size>
                <width>220</width>
                <height>0</height>
               </size>
              </property>
              <property name="toolTip">
               <string>多个语言用分号分隔，例如 Chinese;Japanese。</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
           </layout>
          </item>
         </layout>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item>
        <widget class="QGroupBox" name="grpAudioPreview">
         <property name="title">
          <string>音频分析与预览</string>
         </property>
         <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="audioPreviewLayout">
          <item>
           <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="previewModeRow">
            <item>
             <widget class="QLabel" name="lblPreviewDisplayMode">
              <property name="text">
               <string>显示模式</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QComboBox" name="cbbPreviewDisplayMode">
              <item>
               <property name="text">
                <string>波形</string>
               </property>
              </item>
              <item>
               <property name="text">
                <string>频谱</string>
               </property>
              </item>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <spacer name="previewModeSpacer">
              <property name="orientation">
               <enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum>
              </property>
              <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
               <size>
                <width>40</width>
                <height>20</height>
               </size>
              </property>
             </spacer>
            </item>
           </layout>
          </item>
          <item>
           <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="loudnessBufferRow">
            <item>
             <widget class="QLabel" name="lblLoudnessBuffer">
              <property name="text">
               <string>响度分析分块采样点</string>
              </property>
              <property name="toolTip">
               <string>RMS 响度分析时每个 buffer 的采样点数：每 buffer 单独求功率，剔除低于门限的静音 buffer 后再取平均。分块越大越接近整体响度，越小对静音段更敏感。</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spbLoudnessBuffer">
              <property name="toolTip">
               <string>默认 1024，可调范围 128-65536。响度调整、静音裁剪、音频预览的响度显示共用该值。</string>
              </property>
              <property name="minimum">
               <number>128</number>
              </property>
              <property name="maximum">
               <number>65536</number>
              </property>
              <property name="singleStep">
               <number>128</number>
              </property>
              <property name="value">
               <number>1024</number>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
            <item>
             <spacer name="loudnessBufferSpacer">
              <property name="orientation">
               <enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum>
              </property>
              <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
               <size>
                <width>40</width>
                <height>20</height>
               </size>
              </property>
             </spacer>
            </item>
           </layout>
          </item>
         </layout>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item>
        <widget class="QGroupBox" name="grpRandomCount">
         <property name="title">
          <string>优化随机数量</string>
         </property>
         <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="randomCountLayout">
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="lblRandomCountHint">
            <property name="text">
             <string>每个平台一列，设置允许保留启用的 Random Container 子对象数量；未单独配置的平台使用默认值 3。</string>
            </property>
            <property name="wordWrap">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QTableWidget" name="tblRandomAllowedCounts">
            <property name="maximumSize">
             <size>
              <width>16777215</width>
              <height>80</height>
             </size>
            </property>
            <property name="minimumSize">
             <size>
              <width>0</width>
              <height>60</height>
             </size>
            </property>
            <property name="alternatingRowColors">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
            <property name="selectionBehavior">
             <enum>QAbstractItemView::SelectRows</enum>
            </property>
            <attribute name="verticalHeaderVisible">
             <bool>false</bool>
            </attribute>
           </widget>
          </item>
         </layout>
        </widget>
       </item>
        <item>
         <spacer name="toolsSpacer">
          <property name="orientation">
           <enum>Qt::Vertical</enum>
          </property>
          <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
           <size>
            <width>20</width>
            <height>40</height>
           </size>
          </property>
         </spacer>
        </item>
      </layout>
     </widget>
     <widget class="QWidget" name="tabVersionControl">
      <attribute name="title">
       <string>版本控制</string>
      </attribute>
      <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="tabVersionControlLayout">
       <item>
        <layout class="QFormLayout" name="vcsForm">
         <item row="0" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblVcsMode">
           <property name="text">
            <string>版本控制类型</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="0" column="1">
          <widget class="QComboBox" name="cbbVcsMode">
           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>用于主窗口「集成视图 - 作者」列：读取对象所在 WorkUnit 最后一次提交的提交人。SVN 读本地工作副本（较快）；P4 需连接服务器（首次较慢）。修改后需重启软件生效。</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="1" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblP4Server">
           <property name="text">
            <string>P4 服务器</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="1" column="1">
          <widget class="QLineEdit" name="iptP4Server">
           <property name="placeholderText">
            <string>如 ssl:perforce.example.com:1666；留空表示用 P4 客户端默认值</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="2" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblP4Charset">
           <property name="text">
            <string>P4 字符集</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="2" column="1">
          <widget class="QLineEdit" name="iptP4Charset">
           <property name="placeholderText">
            <string>默认 utf8</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="3" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblP4ChangelistDescription">
           <property name="text">
            <string>P4 提交描述</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="3" column="1">
          <widget class="QLineEdit" name="iptP4ChangelistDescription"/>
         </item>
         <item row="4" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblSvnExecutable">
           <property name="text">
            <string>SVN 可执行文件</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="4" column="1">
          <widget class="QLineEdit" name="iptSvnExecutable">
           <property name="placeholderText">
            <string>已在 PATH 中时直接写 svn，否则写完整路径</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="5" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblSvnUsername">
           <property name="text">
            <string>SVN 用户名</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="5" column="1">
          <widget class="QLineEdit" name="iptSvnUsername"/>
         </item>
         <item row="6" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblSvnPassword">
           <property name="text">
            <string>SVN 密码</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="6" column="1">
          <widget class="QLineEdit" name="iptSvnPassword">
           <property name="echoMode">
            <enum>QLineEdit::Password</enum>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="7" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblSvnCommitMessage">
           <property name="text">
            <string>SVN 提交信息</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="7" column="1">
          <widget class="QLineEdit" name="iptSvnCommitMessage"/>
         </item>
         <item row="8" column="0" colspan="2">
          <widget class="QPushButton" name="btnVcsTest">
           <property name="text">
            <string>测试连接</string>
           </property>
           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>用当前配置读取一次版本信息，验证服务器、工作副本与账号是否可用。</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="9" column="0" colspan="2">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblVcsStatus">
           <property name="text">
            <string>未测试连接</string>
           </property>
           <property name="wordWrap">
            <bool>true</bool>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
        </layout>
       </item>
       <item>
        <spacer name="vcsSpacer">
         <property name="orientation">
          <enum>Qt::Vertical</enum>
         </property>
         <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
          <size>
           <width>20</width>
           <height>40</height>
          </size>
         </property>
        </spacer>
       </item>
      </layout>
     </widget>
     <widget class="QWidget" name="tabAi">
      <attribute name="title">
       <string>AI 助手</string>
      </attribute>
      <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="tabAiLayout">
       <item>
        <layout class="QFormLayout" name="aiForm">
         <item row="0" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblAiMode">
           <property name="text">
            <string>连接模式</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="0" column="1">
          <widget class="QComboBox" name="cbbAiMode">
           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>代理模式走本地/公司代理地址；官方 API 模式按「服务提供方」直连。</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="1" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblAiProvider">
           <property name="text">
            <string>服务提供方</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="1" column="1">
          <widget class="QComboBox" name="cbbAiProvider">
           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>Claude 使用 Anthropic 原生协议，必须填写模型名；其余厂商走 OpenAI 兼容协议。</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="2" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblAiProxy">
           <property name="text">
            <string>代理地址</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="2" column="1">
          <widget class="QLineEdit" name="iptAiProxy">
           <property name="placeholderText">
            <string>http://127.0.0.1:15721</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="3" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblAiBaseUrl">
           <property name="text">
            <string>自定义地址</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="3" column="1">
          <widget class="QLineEdit" name="iptAiBaseUrl">
           <property name="placeholderText">
            <string>官方模式选择“自定义”时填写，如 https://api.example.com</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="4" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblAiApiKey">
           <property name="text">
            <string>API Key</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="4" column="1">
          <widget class="QLineEdit" name="iptAiApiKey">
           <property name="echoMode">
            <enum>QLineEdit::Password</enum>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="5" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblAiModel">
           <property name="text">
            <string>模型</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="5" column="1">
          <widget class="QLineEdit" name="iptAiModel">
           <property name="placeholderText">
            <string>官方模式建议填写（Claude 必填）；代理模式可留空</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="6" column="0" colspan="2">
          <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbxAiEnableScript">
           <property name="text">
            <string>允许 AI 执行临时脚本（run_wwise_script）</string>
           </property>
           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>IDE 调试器下可能不稳定，默认关闭。</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="7" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblAiMaxContext">
           <property name="text">
            <string>单次最大对象数</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="7" column="1">
          <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spnAiMaxContext">
           <property name="minimum">
            <number>1</number>
           </property>
           <property name="maximum">
            <number>10000</number>
           </property>
           <property name="value">
            <number>500</number>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="8" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblAiMaxTurns">
           <property name="text">
            <string>最大对话轮数</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="8" column="1">
          <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spnAiMaxTurns">
           <property name="minimum">
            <number>1</number>
           </property>
           <property name="maximum">
            <number>200</number>
           </property>
           <property name="value">
            <number>10</number>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="9" column="0">
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblAiMutationPolicy">
           <property name="text">
            <string>修改策略</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item row="9" column="1">
          <widget class="QComboBox" name="cbbAiMutationPolicy">
           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>只读＝拒绝一切改动；改动前弹窗确认＝AI 改工程前由你点确认；直接执行＝不再询问。</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
        </layout>
       </item>
       <item>
        <spacer name="aiSpacer">
         <property name="orientation">
          <enum>Qt::Vertical</enum>
         </property>
         <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
          <size>
           <width>20</width>
           <height>40</height>
          </size>
         </property>
        </spacer>
       </item>
      </layout>
     </widget>
     <widget class="QWidget" name="tabAppearance">
      <attribute name="title">
       <string>外观</string>
      </attribute>
      <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="tabAppearanceLayout">
       <item>
       <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="themeRow">
        <item>
         <widget class="QLabel" name="lblTheme">
          <property name="text">
           <string>界面主题</string>
          </property>
         </widget>
        </item>
        <item>
         <widget class="QComboBox" name="cbbTheme">
          <property name="sizePolicy">
           <sizepolicy hsizetype="Expanding" vsizetype="Fixed">
            <horstretch>0</horstretch>
            <verstretch>0</verstretch>
           </sizepolicy>
          </property>
         </widget>
        </item>
       </layout>
      </item>
      <item>
       <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="uiScaleRow">
        <item>
         <widget class="QLabel" name="lblUiScale">
          <property name="text">
           <string>界面缩放</string>
          </property>
          <property name="toolTip">
           <string>跟随系统＝按 Windows 的显示缩放显示；选择具体百分比则固定为该缩放（不再跟随系统）。QT_SCALE_FACTOR 只在启动时生效，改完需要重启软件。</string>
          </property>
         </widget>
        </item>
        <item>
         <widget class="QComboBox" name="cbbUiScale">
          <property name="sizePolicy">
           <sizepolicy hsizetype="Expanding" vsizetype="Fixed">
            <horstretch>0</horstretch>
            <verstretch>0</verstretch>
           </sizepolicy>
          </property>
          <property name="toolTip">
           <string>界面感觉整体被放大（或想固定不放大）时，可在这里选 100% 并重启；屏幕本身是高分屏时选「跟随系统」最合适。</string>
          </property>
         </widget>
        </item>
       </layout>
      </item>
      <item>
        <widget class="QGroupBox" name="grpTableDisplay">
         <property name="title">
          <string>表格显示</string>
         </property>
         <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="layoutTableDisplay">
          <item>
           <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbxPathDisplayCompact">
            <property name="text">
             <string>表格路径显示关键词去重后的简写</string>
            </property>
            <property name="checked">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
          <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbxPathHideRoot">
           <property name="checked">
            <bool>true</bool>
           </property>
           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>勾选后去掉路径开头的根目录（如 \Actor-Mixer Hierarchy、\Events），所有表格与工具窗口共用该显示规则。</string>
           </property>
           <property name="text">
            <string>路径隐藏根目录</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <spacer name="tableDisplaySpacer">
            <property name="orientation">
             <enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum>
            </property>
            <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
             <size>
              <width>40</width>
              <height>20</height>
             </size>
            </property>
           </spacer>
          </item>
